# Kueri's gum inventor: Building_InventorHouse (ps2.asm:18378), building 13
# behind Kueri's door at 15,39 (portrait $0C). GumInvHouseEventIndex:
# $B01 (the $B08 written before it is overwritten at once and never
# shows), then CheckItemExistInventory for ItemID_MruraLeaf. With the leaf
# it is $B05, WinID_YesNo2, and YES (loc_C948) takes the leaf out of the
# holder's bag and puts ItemID_MruraGum after that bag's last item,
# SXFID_ItemReceived and $B06; then CloseAllWindows. No flag is set.
# Before build 76: "level: door to building 13 (portrait $0C) is not
# ported" and the door stayed shut.

start level $08 15 41
wait idle
give MruraLeaf
walk up 1
wait idle
expect level $08 15 40
walk up 1                    # the push into the door
wait screen building
wait idle
expect script $0B01          # "Hi! I'm working on inventing a new kind of gum!"
press c                      # past the {pause}
wait idle
shot 01_inventor
press c
wait idle
expect script $0B05          # "That's it; a MARUERA LEAF! Please give it to me!"
press c                      # past the {pause}
wait idle                    # YES / NO, YES first
shot 02_give_it
press c
wait idle
expect script $0B06          # "Thanks! ... Done! There's plenty, so take some!"
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
shot 03_the_gum
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect item MruraGum
expect no-stderr not ported
